title KubeQuest - tutor communication (numbered messages)
object "Owner browser" as UI
object "Fastify tutor route" as API
object "Reviewed mission content" as Content
object "Lab evidence sanitizer" as Sanitize
object "Ollama qwen2.5:7b" as AI
UI --> API : 1: ask(question, sessionId)
API --> API : 1.1: authorize, check mode, rate and busy lock
API --> Content : 1.2: select bounded guidance
API --> Sanitize : 1.3: request safe resource summary
API --> AI : 1.4: bounded prompt; one active inference
AI --> API : 1.5: suggestion or timeout
API --> UI : 1.6: answer / authored fallback
note bottom of AI
No tools, shell, credentials, or grading authority.
Model output is guidance, not validation evidence.
end note
